#X obj 60 3536 osc~ 110;
#X obj 60 3564 s~ \$0-fmin;
#X text 150 3536 external modulator (fms 2);
#X text 82 3598 Linear FM of the counter rate \, through zero (the counter runs backwards) above index 1 \, every edge band-limited. Not on the Poly-800. \; fm1 \, fm2 (0): depth on DCO1 / DCO2 \, 0-127 = index 0-16 (1 at about 32) \, 0 = off. \; fms (0): chooses the modulator \, it switches nothing on or off: 0 a sine per DCO at fmr x its own 16' frequency plus fmhz \, 1 the other DCO of the voice (cross FM: DCO2 into DCO1 and DCO1 into DCO2) \, 2 the signal at the right inlet (about -1..1: osc~ \, adc~ \, noise~ ...) \, here from the osc~ above. \; fmr (1): 0.125-16 \, whole ratios stay harmonic \, others (1.41 \, 3.5) give bells and metal that follow the key. \; fmhz (0): -1000..1000 Hz added to the sine: a fixed \, inharmonic offset with the same beat on every key (fmr 0.125 \, fmhz 200: almost a fixed modulator)., f 64;
