#X msg 60 4958 mgv \$1;
#X text 82 4996 One triangle MG for the instrument \, measured on a Poly-800 II. It also drives hmg \, pwm1/2 \, wsm and swm (DCO settings). \; mgr (-1): frequency in steps 0-15 as parameter 81 (0: 0.29 Hz / 3: 1.26 / 8: 5.2 / 15: 19 Hz) \, sets mgf. -1 = use mgf. \; mgf (5): the same in Hz. \; mgi (0): depth on the pitch in cents (83: 12.4 cents per step \, 186 at 15) \, a 14.5 Hz low-pass makes fast vibrato shallower \, as on the original. \; mgd (0): delay 0-15 (82: 0.47 s at 5 \, 1.55 s at 15) from the first key \, then full depth. \; mgv (0): MG to the VCF 0-15 (84: +-7.9 octaves at 15)., f 64;
