#X text 82 5498 The digital delay of the Poly-800 II (71-75) \, measured: the echo is in phase on the left output and inverted on the right (a mono sum cancels it). A gate ends the echo train \, changing a value mutes the echo for a moment \, as on the original. \; dtim (30): 0-99 = 4.2 ms - 1.08 s (70: 216 ms). \; dfb (0): feedback 0-15 (15: -3.1 dB per echo). \; dmf (0): mod rate 0-31 = 0.05-5 Hz. \; dmi (0): mod depth 0-31 (31: the time swings 1:5 \, about 10 dB less per 10 steps below). \; dlev (0): echo level 0-15 \, 0 = off. \; Presets: flanger (4 ms \, slow sweep \, feedback) \, chorus1 (fast \, shallow) \, chorus2 (slow \, wider) \, slap (120 ms) \, long (0.5 s with repeats) \, off., f 64;
