#X msg 60 6040 vamp \$1;
#X text 82 6078 Each voice's DCO1 and DCO2 have their own 6-stage DEG as on the Poly-800. Measured on a Poly-800 II: level 0-31 is about (L/31)^2 \, attack rises linearly (31: about 9 s) \, decay \, slope and release fall at a constant dB per second (31: about 18 s to -40 dB). env1 / env2 (Controls) morph through: 0 gate / 1 short pluck / 24 pluck / 48 piano / 72 long release / 92 swell / 108 pad / 127 long pad. \; a1 d1 bp1 sl1 su1 r1: attack \, decay \, break point \, slope \, sustain \, release of DEG1 (DCO1) \, 0-31. Setting one makes env1 -1. \; a2 d2 bp2 sl2 su2 r2: the same for DEG2 (DCO2) \, env2 -1. \; vamp (0): velocity to the level of each voice (both DCOs \, not on the Poly-800): 0 off \, 127 level = velocity., f 64;
#X obj 60 6314 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Portamento 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X obj 460 6372 s \$0-pdoly8;
#X floatatom 60 6348 6 0 127 0 - - -;
