#X msg 60 6434 mono \$1;
#X floatatom 160 6410 6 0 1 0 - - -;
#X msg 160 6434 retr \$1;
#X text 82 6472 Not on the Poly-800. \; port (0): glide time 0-127 = off to 3 s. \; pmod (0): where a glide starts: 0 from the last note played \, 1 from the note this voice played before \, 2 from the last note only while another key is still held (legato glide). pmod is not a mono / poly switch. \; mono (0): 0 poly (4 voices) \, 1 mono: one voice \, the last key wins. \; retr (1): in mono \, 1: every key restarts the envelopes \, 0: legato \, only the first key of a phrase restarts them \, further keys (and going back to a held one) only change the pitch., f 64;
