#X msg 160 6920 leak \$1;
#X text 82 6958 bnd (2): bend range in semitones (original: up to 7). Pitch bend from a MIDI keyboard comes in through [bendin] at the top. \; ch1 (0): MIDI channel for p v ch lists \, 0 = any. \; treb \, bass (0): EQ -6..6 (76/77 \, measured: about 4 dB at 3 \, 10 dB at 6 \, shelves at 4.3 kHz and 115 Hz). \; sprd (0): stereo spread of the 4 voices 0-127. \; mrph (8): smoothing of har and lev changes in ms. \; tone (1): 1: output stage measured on a Poly-800 (54 Hz high-pass \, VCF \, 1 pole at 5 kHz) \, 0: raw tone generators. \; leak (0): 1: released voices stay at -55 dB \, as on the original., f 64;
#X text 82 7178 Credits: Modelled on the Korg Poly-800 service manual\; \; MSM5232\; scale ROM data as documented in MAME's \; msm5232.cpp with help by Claude, f 64;
